s8-6-p5 : Block
s8-6-p5 = prose (cons "A template is represented as a program parameterized by its template arguments, but its interpretation includes these C++ rules. Treating every template declaration as an unconstrained type-level lambda would lose deduction, lookup, overload selection, and substitution-failure behavior. Ordinary function application describes the resulting explicit parameterization after those source rules have been accounted for." nil)
